# Code Owners for the shared security pipeline.
#
# Everything here is a security control for several repositories, so every path is owned.
# Branch protection must have "Require review from Code Owners" enabled, and the team must
# have at least Write access - GitHub rejects an entry whose team lacks access with
# "Unknown owner", and the control then does nothing until it is fixed.
#
# @neotree/core-devs has three members, so a pull-request author - who never satisfies
# their own Code Owner review - always leaves two possible reviewers.

*                       @neotree/core-devs
/security/              @neotree/core-devs
/.github/workflows/     @neotree/core-devs
/templates/             @neotree/core-devs
